  description:
    "Moves the start of a queued job that is waiting for a future time (scheduled, debounced,\nre-scheduled by a concurrency limit, or a flow step waiting on a sleep or a retry delay)\nto now, keeping the same job id. A job with a\nconcurrency limit is still checked against its limit when it is pulled. A schedule's\nupcoming tick is refused, since the schedule would queue that tick again.\n",
